BTU Power Boil Burner\",\"Copy\":\"This 18,000 BTU Power Boil burner produces intense heat to boil water fast.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--dqfkCuIc--/zwyvap16wwcq5naeitrz.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Edge to Edge Cooktop\",\"Copy\":\"Continuous, edge-to-edge cooktop gives you a large cooking space and can handle any cookware.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--2ax4mSqe--/azln0jvv19rp3ro0wemy.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Reversible Grill and Griddle\",\"Copy\":\"This extra-large, reversible grill and griddle combination lets you enjoy the best in cooking versatility.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--mupV7SW1--/xdds9qneu88urqv045bj.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Center Oval Burner\",\"Copy\":\"Custom cookware and griddles easily fit on this powerful fifth central oval burner that offers a flexible cooking solution.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--Q60KOfHS--/wtqtogy8dr2tofbd1pbw.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Convection\",\"Copy\":\"This convection oven has a rear fan that circulates hot air, ensuring more even browning and cooking results.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--YdNAwjhT--/fklnprlmw8bsxq2ygj2x.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Express Preheat\",\"Copy\":\"Get food on the table quicker thanks to a fast preheat oven. In just 7 minutes*, you have a preheated oven. *Preheats oven in just 7 minutes, bake mode to preheat beep, 350 degrees, one standard rack.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--DINg67Aq--/gfe2ymm3w60fk6fq7pch.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"No Preheat Fresh Reheat\",\"Copy\":\"Perfect for leftovers from the night before, the to-go box from your favorite restaurant or refreshing soggy fries to ideal crispiness, this no preheat mode saves you time and delivers flawless results.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--EqXUBp5e--/u73kgodeibzdu5fwlxb9.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"No Preheat Pizza\",\"Copy\":\"Specifically designed to cook your frozen pizza, this no preheat option saves time and ensures perfect pizza from the crust to the toppings.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--jUwCiXuH--/nr3ojlxg322ykrlk046u.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"GE Profile Connect+\",\"Copy\":\"Keep your oven up to date with GE Profile Connect+. Download software upgrades to ensure you always have the latest features, like new Air Fry modes, giving you access to continuous improvements and enhanced cooking experiences.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s---aajtBVj--/lokyvxu6q5r1nlpbfhk2.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Oven Storage Drawer\",\"Copy\":\"The removable oven storage drawer offers convenient storage for cookware and other kitchen accessories.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--4YV5UuDH--/psgcrugh6vz59nxylclc.jpg\"}], \"variants\":[],\"Value_Prop\":\"\"}", "price": {"without_tax": {"formatted": "$999.00", "value": 999, "currency": "USD"}, "tax_label": "Tax", "rrp_without_tax": {"formatted": "$1,399.00", "value": 1399, "currency": "USD"}, "saved": {"formatted": "$400.00", "value": 400, "currency": "USD"}}, "detail_messages": "", "availability": "", "page_title": "", "default_shipping_expectation_prompt": "We ship available items right away, and backordered items as soon as they're in stock", "height": "49.50", "cart_url": "https://www.geappliances.com/cart.php", "show_backorder_availability_prompt": false, "max_purchase_quantity": 1, "show_quantity_on_hand": false, "show_default_shipping_expectation_prompt": false, "show_quantity_on_backorder": false, "brand": {"name": "GE Profile", "url": "https://www.geappliances.com/brands/ge-profile/"}, "attributes": [], "mpn": null, "upc": "084691969006", "shipping_messages": [], "rating": 0, "bulk_discount_rates": [], "meta_keywords": "", "depth": "27.00", "show_quantity_input": 1, "title": "GE Profile\u2122 30\u201d Smart Free-Standing Gas Convection Range with No Preheat Air Fry and EasyWash\u2122 Oven Tray|^|PGF700AYFS", "gift_wrapping_ava